    // Valid help patterns:
    // - ` ` (no args) -> not help, but missing subcommand help (special)
    // - `--help` / `-h` alone -> global help
    // - `build --help` / `build -h` -> build help
    // - `dev --help` / `dev -h` -> dev help
    // - `serve --help` / `serve -h` -> serve help
    // - `generate --help` / `generate -h` -> generate help
    // - `generate ci --help` / `generate ci -h` -> ci help
    // - `config-schema --help` / `config-schema -h` -> config help
    // - `generate-css --help` / `generate-css -h` -> css help
    // - `help` / `help build` / `help dev` etc -> help subcommand
    // Also `help generate ci` etc.
    // For version:
    // - `--version` / `-V` alone -> version
    // - `--version build` / `-V build` etc -> version (version before subcommand)
